icado, com conforto, privacidade e espaços pensados para viver experiências extraordinárias.\n\nUm imóvel singular, onde cada detalhe valoriza a arte de morar bem.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6acfe10e382dc534b491abd4/pilar-homes-images-watermark/54a06e50-3eaf-4335-8861-992cb52eee33.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6acfe10e382dc534b491abd4/pilar-homes-images-watermark/fea27b0d-8791-4bc8-b2a3-56657a99f31a.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6acfe10e382dc534b491abd4/pilar-homes-images-watermark/5743a3cc-24bb-4eb2-99ca-e43347e0f53e.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6acfe10e382dc534b491abd4/pilar-homes-images-watermark/0a282bc4-870d-4a70-95c4-c9fd91bae16a.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6acfe10e382dc534b491abd4/pilar-homes-images-watermark/71f72393-850b-483b-9985-8b3557b35495.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6acfe10e382dc534b491abd4/pilar-homes-images-watermark/4caafe9b-9e12-4732-9ce3-94193e0a0a79.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6acfe10e382dc534b491abd4/pilar-homes-images-watermark/3d329ef4-6f83-437d-a996-fbec63273287.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6acfe10e382dc534b491abd4/pilar-homes-images-watermark/8ef98619-426d-4103-80b9-718ec5adfd6d.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6acfe10e382dc534b491abd4/pilar-homes-images-watermark/33877894-206c-4092-b654-c733c11b1f44.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6acfe10e382dc534b491abd4/pilar-homes-images-watermark/89d56f6d-1b5f-4d91-8d40-68ad0fe26633.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6acfe10e382dc534b491abd4/pilar-homes-images-watermark/03a61409-8d91-4984-afef-bb7af17c124d.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6acfe10e382dc534b491abd4/pilar-homes-images-watermark/9f155dfd-14a9-413b-8fde-ddb84969eb11.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.